  "body": "https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#standard-gatt-units defines attributes like `velocity.metres_per_second`, where the \"`.`\" isn't actually allowed in WebIDL. We need to split attributes like this into a `velocity` attribute whose type is `BluetoothUuidsUnitVelocity`, which contains a `metres_per_second` attribute.\n",
